# =============================================================================
# NFTBan Bot Scanner - Bad Bots (User-Agent Based Detection)
# =============================================================================
# Format: NAME|PATTERN|MATCH_TYPE|THRESHOLD|WINDOW|BAN|ENABLED|DESCRIPTION
#
# MATCH_TYPE for user-agent based detection:
#   useragent  = Match against User-Agent header
#
# These bots are known to be aggressive, ignore robots.txt, or are used
# for malicious purposes. Detection is based on User-Agent strings.
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# AGGRESSIVE CRAWLERS (Ignore robots.txt, excessive crawling)
# =============================================================================
PETALBOT|PetalBot|useragent|20|60|3600|true|Huawei's PetalBot - aggressive crawler
AWARIOBOT|AwarioBot|useragent|20|60|3600|true|AwarioBot - aggressive social monitoring bot
SEMRUSHBOT|SemrushBot|useragent|50|300|1800|false|SEMrush bot - can be aggressive
AHREFSBOT|AhrefsBot|useragent|50|300|1800|false|Ahrefs SEO bot - can be aggressive
MAUIBOT|MauiBot|useragent|20|60|3600|true|MauiBot - known aggressive crawler
DOTBOT|DotBot|useragent|30|120|3600|true|DotBot - aggressive SEO crawler
BLEXBOT|BLEXBot|useragent|30|120|3600|true|BLEXBot - aggressive crawler
MEGAINDEX|MegaIndex|useragent|30|120|3600|true|MegaIndex - Russian SEO bot
ZOOMINFOBOT|ZoominfoBot|useragent|30|120|3600|true|ZoomInfo scraper bot
LINKFLUENCE|linkfluence|useragent|30|120|3600|true|Linkfluence crawler

# =============================================================================
